WEBVTT

00:01.240 --> 00:04.640
With my meager virtue, I have reigned for 27 years.

00:05.680 --> 00:11.120
Worries accumulated in my heart, working diligently without rest fearing I would fail the ancestral foundation.

00:12.640 --> 00:15.560
Now the realm is settled, the divine land recovered.

00:16.200 --> 00:20.920
I am gravely ill and cannot rise this is the natural way of life and death.

00:21.000 --> 00:25.000
Unavoidable for all people, past and present you need not lament.

00:26.200 --> 00:30.787
Grand Censor Wang Ming just and loyal, serving the state, inheriting clarity.

00:31.080 --> 00:36.480
In the future, he may be the first among your advisors the succession has found the right person.

00:36.560 --> 00:40.400
The ancestral temple and people have someone to rely on though I depart this world.

00:41.080 --> 00:43.080
What regrets do I have?

